{"id":"vod_sn_37367","vodId":"37367","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"人鱼又上钩","name_cn":"人鱼又上钩","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d8d3ececad78d6e99309acf842ec369d.jpg"},"summary":"在少年向岛拓朗（水岛大宙 配音）平凡的一生中，钓鱼是他最大的爱好，他常常独自一人带着吊具来到堤岸边，享受爱好带给他快乐和自在。一次偶然中，阿拓竟然吊上了一只名叫室见（田村由香里 配音）的奇怪人鱼，这只人鱼性格开朗活泼热情，只是有些缺心眼的个性令人十分在意。　　就这样，阿拓和室见之间的奇妙情缘开始了。与此同时，室见的好友，成熟稳重，渴望和人类恋爱的隅田（上坂堇 配音）、和谁都能成为好朋友的素食主义者小樋（野中蓝 配音）、身材火爆自己却完全不以为意，眼中只容得下室见的富士（原田瞳 配音）等众人鱼纷纷登场了。在大海和陆地之中，会有怎样有趣的故事即将展开呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4GEbnBeLB31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YKFeSGRfYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pnpS2EZqbz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BfsDf4yzjH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rJrX3K4nQQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rD4eEuZmnG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EqEfSvMu5K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v6PkRcu4Y41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tippvSAsFZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WcwQqjK3kb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EQWbLu2piN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wcrSauKtrg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/itBZH4FJ1g1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.795Z"}